  "changes": [
    "Macro mode's source imported unchanged from toonst/digi_macro at 62f0b0a: the eleven files under src/, its LICENSE and its README (as upstream/README.md).",
    "build.json is written from upstream's mods/dt2/mod.json and mods/dt2/project.json, the build upstream makes with MM_KITS=project: the same sources, flags (-DMM_DT2, -DMM_FEATURE_KITS, -DMM_PROJECT_ONLY), subscriptions, contribution and claims. One setup per project, in core's project data alone: no kit data, no PERSONALIZE row, no card sectors.",
    "It has no stock sites: everything the module hooks is the base's. src/mm_kits.c includes the base's header under either of its names (mk2/core.h here)."
  ],
